WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.780
Today we are playing king of the table.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.880
The winner stays on, first to 11 points wins.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.200
And there's a special rule if you win 3 points in a row

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:13.740
Lets go!

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.880
Two same colors start.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.960
You start.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.300
Okay, 0-0-0.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.480
What happened there!?

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.700
Are you okay?

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:54.180
I could say that there's not enough room here!

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.280
Are you sure you don't want to come on this side?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.980
I think I'm good thanks

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.660
I need to get my first point

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:12.860
That's how you do it!

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:13.700
Where did that come from?

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.000
Never play to Otto's backhand!

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:22.380
No!

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.260
My own spin!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.700
That was my third in a row.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.400
Special rule!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.140
Only forehand because your backhand is so overpowered.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.300
You saw that footwork?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:56.900
Yeah!

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.220
When Otto has to do footwork he can do footwork

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.400
Well, that was my sixth in a row.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.040
Should there be another special rule?

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.920
Yeah double special rule!

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.480
Right hand and only forehand

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.400
There's no chance I'm gonna win this point!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.760
I had to go for it!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.020
Nice!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.400
Pardon!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.480
Two times in a row

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.680
Don't give me there!

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.600
It feels like I've said that before

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.240
Don't give me there!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.160
Don't give me there!

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.860
That's the biggest
mistake you can make.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.200
This is unbelievable!

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.560
There's nothing you can do!

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:33.980
No!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.440
Not even with the sorry point.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:08.540
Yes!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.700
Now that I deserve!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.820
I deserve that one

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.380
What was that block?

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.100
Twiddle master

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:33.740
Match point!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.820
Another match point

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.680
I also needed one.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.360
You deserve that Emil!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.300
Probably yeah!

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:02.300
So today the king of the table was the Sensei

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.300
Congratulations!

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:03.940
Thanks!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.540
Anyway remember to subsribe here

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.720
and watch our previous videos there

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.140
Until next time!

